! Fully absorbing wall model for all non-electron species.
! Electron absorption uses a segmented glass-wall model:
!   E < 80 eV: fully absorbed
!   E >= 80 eV: 90% absorbed. For E >= the energy_cll threshold, at most
!                10% of primaries may reflect; SEE is handled separately.

